收紧核心，缓慢将躯干向右旋转至舒适范围。
在旋转末端稍作停顿，然后转回中间，继续向左旋转。
以缓慢可控的方式持续左右交替，完成目标次数。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-seated-side-reach-stretch', '坐姿侧伸拉伸', 'seated side reach stretch', 'core', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '坐在地面上，双腿交叉或向前伸直。
将右臂举过头顶，躯干向左侧倾斜。
右臂向远侧伸展，感受躯干右侧的拉伸。
保持20-30秒，然后换另一侧。
每侧按目标保持次数重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-seated-with-leg-raise-balance-hold', '坐姿抬腿平衡保持', 'seated with leg raise balance hold', 'core', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '坐于地面，双膝弯曲，双脚平放地面。
