顶端停顿，然后缓慢将双腿放回起始位置。
身体不摆动，按目标次数重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-hanging-knee-raise-captain-s-chair', '悬垂屈膝举腿', 'hanging knee raise (captain''s chair)', 'core', 'bodyweight', 1, 2, '坐在罗马椅（队长椅）上，前臂放在垫上，背部贴靠支撑。
