放下髋部休息，然后换另一侧重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-wall-upper-body-side-bent-hand-overhead', '靠墙上半身侧屈手上举', 'wall upper body side bent hand overhead', 'core', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '侧身靠墙站立，双脚并拢，近侧手扶墙支撑。
