双脚沿墙收回并拢，重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-supine-setup-pnf-hamstring-stretch', '仰卧准备-PNF腘绳肌拉伸', 'supine setup - pnf hamstring stretch', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '仰卧平躺，一侧膝盖弯曲，脚掌平放地面。
让同伴将你另一条伸直的腿向天花板方向抬起，直到感到轻微的腘绳肌拉伸。
用中等力度将抬起的腿压向同伴的手，持续5-8秒，同伴给予阻力。
完全放松腿部。
让同伴轻轻将腿进一步推入拉伸位置，保持20-30秒。
缓慢放下腿，换另一侧重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-side-lying-single-leg-up', '仰卧单腿上举', 'side lying single leg up', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '侧卧，身体呈一条直线，双腿叠放。
下方手放在垫子上保持稳定，头靠在手臂上。
保持髋部叠放并收紧核心。
缓慢将上方腿抬高至舒适高度，不要旋转髋部。
有控制地放回起始位置。
重复目标次数后换边。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-lying-single-bent-knee-hold-stretch', '仰卧单腿屈膝抱膝拉伸', 'lying single bent knee hold stretch', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '仰卧，双腿伸直。
