膝盖微屈轻柔落地，立即下蹲进入下一次深蹲。
按目标次数重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-skater-jump', '滑冰式跳跃', 'skater jump', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 2, '单腿站立在右腿上，左脚稍微离地。
屈右膝爆发蹬地，向左侧跳。
用左脚柔和落地，右腿向后摆动，右手伸向左脚。
立即左脚蹬地，跳回右侧。
以连续滑冰动作交替两侧，按目标次数继续。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-skater-hops', '滑冰跳', 'skater hops', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 2, '单腿站立在右腿上，膝盖微屈。
右脚蹬地，向侧方跳跃落在左脚上。
屈膝用左脚柔和落地以缓冲冲击。
立即向右蹬地，落在右脚上。
以滑冰动作持续左右跳跃。
按目标次数或时长重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-slider-split', '滑盘分腿', 'slider split', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 2, '站立，一只脚踩在滑盘上，双脚并拢。
后脚向后滑动，同时下蹲至分腿蹲位置。
前膝对准脚尖方向，躯干保持直立。
收缩前腿将滑动脚拉回，恢复站立姿势。
一侧完成全部次数后换边。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-warm-up-lateral-lunges', '热身侧弓步', 'warm up lateral lunges', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '双脚并拢站立，双手叉腰。
