放松后换另一侧重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-quadriceps-hold-stretch', '股四头肌静力拉伸', 'quadriceps hold stretch', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '单腿直立，必要时扶墙或支撑物保持平衡。
弯曲另一侧膝盖，手在身后握住脚踝。
将脚跟拉向臀部，直到大腿前侧有拉伸感。
保持20-30秒。
放松后换另一侧重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-shoulder-bridge-kick', '肩桥踢腿', 'shoulder bridge kick', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 2, '仰卧，双膝弯曲，双脚与髋同宽平放于垫上。
双脚踩实垫子，将髋部抬起进入桥式位置。
收紧核心，伸直一条腿，向天花板方向延伸。
将有控制的伸直腿向垫子方向下踢，然后抬回。
一侧重复目标次数后换腿。
将髋部放回垫上完成本组。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-pulse-sumo-squat', '脉冲相扑深蹲', 'pulse sumo squat', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '双脚宽于肩站立，脚尖向外。
下蹲至深相扑蹲位置。
在底部做小幅上下脉冲动作，不完全起身。
按目标次数或时间持续脉冲。
完全站起完成本组。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-heel-beat', '脚跟交替踢', 'heel beat', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '俯卧在垫子上，额头靠在双手上。
收紧核心和臀肌，将双腿稍微抬离垫子。
脚尖稍微外旋，使脚跟相对。
以小幅可控的动作快速将脚跟相互碰击。
持续目标次数或时间，保持稳定呼吸。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-heel-slides', '脚跟滑动', 'heel slides', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '仰卧平躺，双腿伸展，脚跟下放置光滑表面或滑盘。
收紧核心，弯曲膝盖，缓慢将双脚跟向臀部方向滑动。
脚跟靠近臀部后，缓慢滑回起始位置。
整个动作过程中保持下背部贴紧地面。
重复目标次数。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-hamstring-stretch', '腘绳肌拉伸', 'hamstring stretch', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '直立站立，双脚与肩同宽。
双手略宽于肩握住阻力带，双臂伸直举过头顶。
收紧核心，通过将肘部向下向外发力将阻力带拉开。
将阻力带向下拉至颈后，直到到达上背部，同时挤压肩胛骨。
缓慢控制阻力，将双臂举回起始过头位置。
按目标次数重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-leg-press', '腿举', 'leg press', 'legs', 'machine', 1, 1, '坐在腿举机上，背部平贴靠垫，双脚与髋同宽踩在踏板上。
松开安全把手，屈膝将踏板向胸部方向下放。
当膝盖约呈90度角时停止，保持下背部紧贴靠垫。
通过脚跟发力将踏板推离，充分伸展双腿但不要锁死膝盖。
按目标次数重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-calf-raise-leg-press', '腿举机提踵', 'calf raise leg press', 'legs', 'machine', 0, 1, '坐在腿举机上，将前脚掌放在踏板下缘。
解锁器械并伸直双腿，膝盖保持微屈。
通过踝关节跖屈向前压脚尖，尽可能高地抬起脚跟。
在最高点停顿，挤压小腿。
慢慢将脚跟放回起始位置，重复目标次数。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-hip-thrust-on-leg-press', '腿举机臀推', 'hip thrust on leg press', 'legs', 'machine', 1, 2, '坐在腿举机上，仅上背部贴靠座椅，双脚放在踏板上较低位置。
将髋部滑离座椅，使身体伸展，以踏板作为阻力。
脚跟发力向上伸展髋部，在顶部收紧臀肌。
在动作顶部短暂停顿。
缓慢将髋部放回起始位置，重复至目标次数。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-leg-press-frog-stance', '腿举蛙式站姿', 'leg press frog stance', 'legs', 'machine', 1, 2, '坐在腿举机上，双脚宽距且较高地踩在踏板上，脚尖朝外。
屈膝下放重量，让膝盖向外朝肘部方向移动。
通过脚跟发力伸展双腿回到起始位置，不要锁死膝盖。
在顶端稍作停顿，收紧臀肌。
按目标次数重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-legs-flutter', '腿部扑动', 'legs flutter', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '仰卧平躺，双腿伸直，双臂放在身体两侧。
收紧核心，将下背部压向垫面。
将双腿抬离垫面几英寸。
双腿交替上下做小而快速的摆动踢腿。
持续目标次数或时间，保持稳定呼吸。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-leg-circle', '腿部画圈', 'leg circle', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '仰卧在垫子上，一条腿伸直放在垫上，另一条腿抬向天花板。
收紧核心，将髋部稳定压在垫子上。
用抬起的腿画一个大圆，依次横过身体、向下、向外、再回到上方。
沿一个方向完成目标圈数，然后反向。
换腿，在另一侧重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-glute-lift-leg-curl', '臀举（腿弯举）', 'glute lift (leg curl)', 'legs', 'machine', 1, 1, '俯卧于腿弯举机，垫片置于脚踝上方。
握住把手稳定身体，将髋部压向凳面。
双腿向上弯举向臀部，动作顶端收紧。
顶峰时注重臀肌发力而非仅靠腘绳肌。
缓慢将腿放回起始位置，按目标次数重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-glute-drive-machine', '臀推机', 'glute drive machine', 'legs', 'machine', 1, 1, '坐入臀推机，调整垫片舒适地横放在髋部。
双脚平放于踏板，与髋同宽。
脚跟发力将髋部向前推入垫片，顶端完全伸展髋部。
顶峰收缩时收紧臀肌并保持片刻。
缓慢将重量放回起始位置。
按目标次数重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-thrust-to-abduction', '臀推至外展', 'thrust to abduction', 'legs', 'band', 1, 1, '将阻力带套在膝盖上方，仰卧，屈膝，双脚平放地面。
脚跟发力做臀桥，将髋部向天花板方向顶起。
在臀桥顶端，双膝对抗阻力带向外分开做外展动作。
双膝并拢，髋部放下回到起始位置。
重复至目标次数。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-glute-bridge-hold', '臀桥保持', 'glute bridge hold', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '仰卧，屈膝，双脚平放地面，与髋同宽。
双臂平放在身体两侧地面，掌心向下。
通过脚跟发力抬起臀部，直到肩膀到膝盖呈一条直线。
在顶部用力收紧臀部。
保持该姿势所需时间，保持稳定呼吸。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-glute-bridge-marching', '臀桥行军', 'glute bridge marching', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '仰卧，屈膝，双脚平放地面，与髋同宽。
通过脚跟发力将臀部抬至臀桥位置。
保持桥式，将一只脚抬离地面，膝盖向胸部靠近。
将该脚放下，对侧重复，呈交替行军模式。
全程保持臀部水平，继续按所需次数重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-glute-bridge-march', '臀桥行进', 'glute bridge march', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '仰卧，屈膝，双脚平放地面，与髋同宽。
通过脚跟发力将臀部抬至臀桥位置。
保持臀部桥式高度，像行军一样将一侧膝盖抬向胸部。
将该脚放回地面，另一侧重复。
继续交替双腿，按所需次数重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-glute-leg-lift-stretch', '臀腿抬高拉伸', 'glute leg lift stretch', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '四点跪姿，双手位于肩下，膝盖位于髋下。
一条腿向后伸直，与躯干成一直线。
将伸直的腿向上抬起，顶端收紧臀肌。
短暂保持后将腿放回髋部高度。
按目标次数重复后换腿。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-glute-and-hips-open-stretch', '臀髋打开拉伸', 'glute and hips open stretch', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '坐在地上，双脚脚底相对呈蝴蝶式。
从髋部向前倾，胸部向双脚方向下压。
双手放在脚上或地上辅助拉伸。
保持20–30秒，感受臀部和内大腿的拉伸。
回到直立姿势，按需重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-reverse-lunges', '自重后弓步', 'reverse lunges', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '双脚与髋同宽站立，双手叉腰或向前伸展以保持平衡。
一只脚直接向后迈步，降低髋部直至双膝约呈90度。
前膝保持对准前脚踝，躯干保持直立。
前脚发力推回站立位置。
换另一侧交替进行，按目标次数重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-bodyweight-jump-squat-wide-leg-1', '自重宽腿跳蹲1', 'bodyweight jump squat wide leg 1', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 2, '双脚站距宽于肩，脚尖稍向外转。
屈膝、臀部后推，下蹲。
脚跟爆发发力，跳离地面。
膝盖微屈柔和落地，用腿部缓冲冲击。
立即再次下蹲并重复至目标次数。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-garland-pose-malasana', '花环式', 'garland pose (malasana)', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '双脚略宽于髋部站立，脚尖向外转约45度。
弯曲膝盖，下蹲至深蹲位置，臀部向地面靠近。
双手在胸前合十，肘部抵住膝盖内侧。
保持脊柱延展、胸部上提，用肘部轻轻将膝盖向外推。
保持30-60秒，然后双脚发力回到站立。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-med-ball-slam-on-floor-in-lunges', '药球弓步砸地', 'med ball slam on floor in lunges', 'legs', 'other', 1, 2, '呈弓步姿势站立，一只脚在前，双手将药球举过头顶。
下蹲成弓步，同时将药球向下砸向地面。
捡起球，回到起始位置。
按目标次数重复后换腿。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-medicine-ball-squat-throw', '药球深蹲抛球', 'medicine ball squat throw', 'legs', 'other', 1, 2, '双脚与肩同宽站立，双手持药球于胸前。
下蹲至大腿与地面平行。
爆发力站起，将球垂直向上抛至最高。
在下落时接住球，立即下蹲进入下一次。
重复至目标次数。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-med-ball-slam-burpee', '药球砸地波比跳', 'med ball slam burpee', 'legs', 'other', 1, 3, '站立，双手将药球举过头顶。
用力将球砸向地面，然后立即下蹲做波比跳。
双手撑地，双脚向后跳，做一个俯卧撑。
双脚向前跳，捡起球，站起。
将球举过头顶，按目标次数重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-balls-slam-on-wall-squat', '药球砸墙深蹲', 'balls slam on wall squat', 'legs', 'other', 1, 2, '面向坚固墙壁站立，双手在胸前持药球。
下蹲，保持背部挺直、挺胸。
从深蹲起身时，爆发力将球砸向墙壁。
接住反弹的球，立即再次下蹲。
按目标次数重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-medicine-ball-walking-lunge-twist', '药球行走弓步转体', 'medicine ball walking lunge twist', 'legs', 'other', 1, 2, '双脚并拢站立，双臂前伸，双手持药球于胸前。
一只脚向前迈成弓步，后膝向地面下压。
在弓步底部，将躯干和球转向前膝方向。
回到中间，后脚向前迈，进入下一次弓步。
持续向前行走，每次弓步时扭转，重复至目标次数。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-clamshell-single-leg-raise', '蚌式单腿抬起', 'clamshell single leg raise', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 2, '侧卧，髋部叠放，膝盖弯曲成45度角。
从髋部旋转，将上方膝盖向上打开，像贝壳一样。
在贝壳打开顶端，将上方腿伸直后再合拢。
屈膝收回，放回起始位置。
重复至目标次数，然后换另一侧。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-clamshell-legs-up', '蚌式双腿抬起', 'clamshell legs up', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 2, '侧卧，髋部和膝盖弯曲成45度角，双脚叠放。
将双脚抬离垫子，保持并拢并与髋部齐平。
保持双脚抬起，将上方膝盖向上旋转，像贝壳打开一样。
在动作顶端稍作停顿，然后缓慢将膝盖放回下方。
重复至目标次数，然后换另一侧。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-clamshell-leg-bent', '蚌式屈腿', 'clamshell leg bent', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '侧卧，髋部和膝盖弯曲约45度，双脚叠放。
保持双脚并拢，像贝壳打开一样将上方膝盖向上抬起。
尽可能抬高膝盖，同时不要向后旋转髋部。
有控制地将膝盖降回起始位置。
按所需次数重复后换边。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-clamshell', '蚌式开合', 'clamshell', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '侧卧，膝盖弯曲约45度，双脚叠放。
保持双脚并拢，将上方膝盖向上旋转到舒适范围，同时不要翻转髋部。
在动作顶部停顿，然后慢慢将膝盖降回起始位置。
按所需次数重复。
换边重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-clamshell-leg-raise', '蚌式抬腿', 'clamshell leg raise', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 2, '侧卧，双腿叠放并伸直。
将上方腿以大幅弧线向上打开，保持腿伸直。
将腿抬到舒适高度，同时不要向后翻转髋部。
将腿降回起始位置。
按所需次数重复后换边。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-frog-wide-leg-squat', '蛙式宽腿深蹲', 'frog wide leg squat', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '站立，双脚明显宽于肩，脚尖外转。
双手合于胸前或放于髋部。
屈膝，髋部向地面下沉做深蹲。
在底部让膝盖向外打开，与脚尖方向一致。
脚跟发力回到站立，重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-frog-stretch', '蛙式拉伸', 'frog stretch', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '从四肢跪地开始，缓慢将双膝向两侧分开至大腿内侧有拉伸感。
前臂放低至地面以加深拉伸。
双脚与膝盖对齐，下背部保持中立。
保持姿势30-60秒，平稳呼吸。
将双膝收回并拢退出拉伸。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-frog-rock-to-knee-lift', '蛙式摇摆至提膝', 'frog rock to knee lift', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 2, '从四肢跪地的青蛙姿势开始，双膝打开，双脚外转。
髋部轻柔向脚跟方向后摇。
向前摇动，在前摇末端将一侧膝盖抬离地面。
膝盖放回地面，再次后摇。
继续交替抬膝至目标次数。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-frog-pilate', '蛙式普拉提', 'frog pilate', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '仰卧，屈膝，双脚并拢，膝盖向外打开成青蛙姿势。
收紧核心，下背部轻压垫面。
双腿斜向伸直，脚跟并拢挤压。
屈膝收回至起始青蛙姿势。
重复至目标次数。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-frog-pilate-advanced', '蛙式普拉提进阶', 'frog pilate advanced', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 3, '仰卧，双腿抬至90度，脚尖外转，脚跟并拢。
抬起头肩离开垫面，收紧核心。
呼气时双腿斜向蹬出，保持脚跟并拢。
屈膝收回至起始位置。
同时双臂向前脉动以加深核心收紧。
重复至目标次数。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-frog-pumps', '蛙式泵动', 'frog pumps', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '仰卧，脚掌相对，膝盖向两侧打开成蝴蝶姿势。
双臂平放于身体两侧地面以稳定身体。
收紧臀肌，将髋部向天花板方向顶起。
在顶端停顿，保持收缩片刻。
髋部放低至接近地面，重复至目标次数。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-bhekasana-frog-pose', '蛙式瑜伽', 'bhekasana frog pose', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 3, '俯卧在垫子上，双腿伸直，双臂放在身体两侧。
屈双膝，双手向后抓住脚背。
将双脚压向髋部旁的地面，同时抬起胸部和 thighs 离开垫子。
肩胛骨内收，目光保持向前。
保持姿势20-30秒，平稳呼吸，然后松开并休息。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-frog-glute-bridge', '蛙式臀推', 'frog glute bridge', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '仰卧，双脚脚掌相对，双膝向两侧打开呈青蛙姿势。
双脚相互压紧，髋部向上顶起成臀桥。
在动作顶端用力收紧臀部。
控制髋部缓慢回到地面。
按目标次数重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-frog-pose-mandukasana', '蛙式（Mandukasana）', 'frog pose (mandukasana)', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 2, '从手膝跪地的桌面姿势开始。
缓慢将双膝尽量向两侧滑开至舒适宽度，脚踝与膝盖对齐。
前臂放低至垫面，髋部向地面下沉。
双脚勾起，脚内侧和膝盖贴住垫面。
保持拉伸30-60秒，深呼吸感受髋部，然后缓慢将双膝收回并拢。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-spiderman-lunges', '蜘蛛侠弓步', 'spiderman lunges', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '从高平板支撑姿势开始，双手位于肩膀正下方。
右脚向前迈出，落在右手外侧。
保持该姿势片刻，感受髋屈肌和腹股沟的拉伸。
将脚返回起始平板支撑位置。
换左侧重复，交替双腿进行至目标次数。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-butter-fly-stretch', '蝴蝶式拉伸', 'butter fly stretch', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '坐在地面上，双脚脚掌相对，让膝盖自然向外打开。
双手握住双脚。
用双肘轻轻将膝盖压向地面。
从髋部微微前倾以加深拉伸。
保持20–30秒，按需重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-butterfly-pose-baddha-konasana', '蝴蝶式瑜伽拉伸', 'butterfly pose (baddha konasana)', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '坐在地面上，保持脊柱挺直，将双脚脚掌在身前相对贴合。
让双膝向两侧下沉，用双手握住双脚。
保持背部挺直，用双肘轻轻将膝盖压向地面。
如果舒适，从髋部微微前倾以加深拉伸。
保持该姿势30-60秒，深呼吸，然后缓慢放松。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-crab-walk', '螃蟹走', 'crab walk', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '坐在地上，屈膝，双脚踩平，双手撑在髋后，手指朝前。
将髋部抬离地面，进入蟹式姿势。
通过对侧手脚配合向前或向后移动。
全程保持髋部抬高并收紧核心。
持续至目标距离或时间。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-walking-lunge', '行走弓步', 'walking lunge', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '直立站立，双脚并拢，双手放在髋部或身体两侧。
右脚向前迈步，弯曲双膝降低身体。
后膝向地面下降，但不要触地。
右脚发力蹬地，左脚向前迈步进入下一次弓步。
继续向前行走至目标步数或距离。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-weighted-step-up', '负重登台阶', 'weighted step-up', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '站在稳固的箱子或长凳前，双手各持一只哑铃。
右脚踩上台面，通过右脚跟发力将身体撑起。
左脚跟上，完全站上箱子。
右脚先退下，然后左脚退下。
继续以同一腿领先或左右交替，按目标次数重复。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-step-ups-weighted', '负重登阶', 'step-ups (weighted)', 'legs', 'dumbbell', 1, 2, '站在箱子或长凳前，双手各持哑铃垂于体侧。
一只脚踩上表面，通过该脚跟发力将身体抬起。
后脚跟上，完全站在箱子上。
前脚先退下到地面，后脚跟随。
交替领先腿，或在一侧完成所有次数后换边。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-foot-arch-stretch', '足弓拉伸', 'foot arch stretch', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 0, 1, '站立或坐着，将一只脚交叉放在对侧膝盖上。
用手轻轻将脚趾向小腿方向拉回。
保持拉伸20-30秒，感受脚底和小腿的拉伸。
放松后换另一只脚重复。
每侧按目标次数进行。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-foot-arch-squeeze', '足弓挤压', 'foot arch squeeze', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 0, 1, '坐在地板或椅子上，双脚平放在地面。
