足弓向下挤压，抓住物体。
保持收缩3-5秒，然后放松。
按目标次数重复后换脚。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-sit-on-ankle', '跪坐脚踝', 'sit on ankle', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '在柔软表面上跪姿开始，双膝并拢，脚趾向后。
