如需加深拉伸，可将双手放在抬起的膝盖上轻轻下压。
保持20-30秒，然后换侧。', '[]', 1, 'vital_animations', 'Vital Animations EULA 2026.1', NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_zh=VALUES(name_zh), name_en=VALUES(name_en), muscle_group=VALUES(muscle_group), equipment=VALUES(equipment), is_compound=VALUES(is_compound), difficulty=VALUES(difficulty), instructions=VALUES(instructions), source=VALUES(source), license=VALUES(license);
INSERT INTO exercises (slug, name_zh, name_en, muscle_group, equipment, is_compound, difficulty, instructions, contraindications, is_active, source, license, created_at) VALUES ('vital-wall-glute-bridge', '靠墙臀桥', 'wall glute bridge', 'legs', 'bodyweight', 1, 1, '仰卧，双脚平贴墙壁，膝盖弯曲约90度。
双臂平放于身体两侧地面以保持稳定。
